    "detailed_description": "Banchou Tactics is a strategy turn based role-playing game in the Japanese Gangster High School (Banchou).<br>Game inspire by Crows (Japanese Manga) River City Ransom and Final Fantasy Tactics.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981160/extras/petal-20220426-161733.GIF?t=1725002418\" /></div><br><br><strong>STORY</strong><br><br>For several years of conflicts, there were bloody struggles between three high schools around this area (somewhere in Japan).  This madness played by the three schools: Sakae High School, Nakamura Technical High School and Minato High School.  They engaged in many fierce battles with the aim to show who\u2019s boss in this town. <br><br>When Kitagawa Seiichi, the demon king of Minato High School just graduated last year, all the balance of three power came to doubt once again.<br><br>The game is set in Minato High School The story focuses on TAIGA ARASHI.<br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><br>- High quality 2D pixel on 3D stage<br>- Turn based strategy game<br>- Special Attack<br>- Knock back system<br>- Combo system",
